        },
        {
          "text": "baca bēgēra Zerubabeli n’abakuru b’amazu ya ba sekuruza, barababgira, bat’ Enda dufatanye namwe kwubaka, kuko dusenga Imana yanyu nk’uko namwe muyisenga; kandi twamye tuyishikanira ibimazi uhereye ku ngoma ya Esarihadoni, umwami w’i Ashuri yatudūganye akatuzana ino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
