              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw ico cete c’umwami Aritazeruzi kimaze gusomerwa uwo mujanama Rehumu na Shimushayi umukarani na bagenzi babo, baca baja i Yerusalemu, ah’ Abayuda bari, bababuza kwubaka ku bubasha no ku kagōbēro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
