              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw igikorwa c’ingoro y’ Imana ir’i Yerusalemu barakireka, gushitsa mu mwaka ugira kabiri Dariyo umwami w’i Buperesi ari ku ngoma.",
          "type": "text",
